    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa Daudini hayyu Saulo duraa baqate Ziklagiti gale, jari askarti, ka guddo huji beekhu kunini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka fiit'a Saulo, ka gosa Benjamini, gara isaa d'ufe. Worri harka mirgichaafi bitaachaleeni t'iyaafi gullubale darbu beekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jara kana ch'ufa Ahiezerifi Yoashi, ilmaani Shemaa ta Gibea d'ufteti iti mata. Jari sunini kana:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.3+1CH.12.4+1CH.12.5+1CH.12.6+1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.3",
              "1CH.12.4",
              "1CH.12.5",
              "1CH.12.6",
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Worra gosa Gadi ka Daudi gula yae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.3+1CH.12.4+1CH.12.5+1CH.12.6+1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.3",
              "1CH.12.4",
              "1CH.12.5",
              "1CH.12.6",
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunini maqa askarti gurra qabdu, ta guddo huji beetu, ta gosa Gadi, ta d'ufte goli Daudi taate, gaafa inni lafa gamooji fulla jabeesani jaarani, keesa tau. Worri kunini ch'ufti guddo wonteefi woraanani woi had'u beekha, fuuli worra aka fuula nyeench'a nama sodaachisa ammalle akuma gadamsa gaara ira oria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunini maqa worraa aka worri guddinnaani wolti aanu gula: Ezeri, Obadia, Eliabu, Mishmana, Yeremia, Atai, Elieli, Yohana, Elsabadi, Yeremia, Makabanai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.9+1CH.12.10+1CH.12.11+1CH.12.12+1CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.9",
              "1CH.12.10",
              "1CH.12.11",
              "1CH.12.12",
              "1CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.9+1CH.12.10+1CH.12.11+1CH.12.12+1CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.9",
              "1CH.12.10",
              "1CH.12.11",
              "1CH.12.12",
              "1CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jari gosa Gadi kunini hagi toko askarti kuma tokoti mata, hagi tokoleeni askarti d'ibba tokoti mata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa toko jia qara ka ganna toko, bara galaani Yordani fach'ae worri galaana taake, worra bale keesa ilaborutifi ila adu tau gargari baqachise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Worra gosa Benjaminitifi ka Yuda ka Daudi gula yae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa toko nami gosa Benjaminitifi ka Yuda hagi toko yae fulla jabeesani jaarani, ta Daudini keesa tau, artiti isati d'ufani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini fuula keesa d'ufe waan jed'eeni, Yo isani aka jaala na qarqaaru d'uftani, anini kurfo jira aka isaniini wold'annu. Ammo yo isani na sobdani harka nyaapa kiyyati na kennu feetani ka anini woma isani ira iyyakini, Waaqi ababoota teenna ha arge isani balleesuti! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani lubbuuni Waaqa jara keesa, namicha Amasai jed'ani toko, ka eege jara sodoma kaani mata iti tahe, ira buute, jennaani inni waan jed'e, Daudi ilma Yese, nu goli tanteeti! Waaqi siifi goli tante ch'ufa qarqaare eebisinna, inni gamuma kanke jira, Daudini worra fud'ate goli ufiiti dare askarti isa keesa guddinna kenneefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nama gosa Manase ka Daudi gula yae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jari gosa Manase hagi toko d'ufe, goli Dauditi darame gaafa inni worra Filisti woliini Saulo had'u d'aqe. Ammo taatule inni worra Filisti inqarqaare, wonti akanatiifi hayyooti worraa waan Daudini harka Sauloti worra kenne seete sodaate; tanaafi isa Ziklagiti keesa deebisani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askartini gosa Manase, ta gaafa Daudini Ziklagiti deebie goli isaa taate, tana: Adina, Yozabadi, Yediaeli, Mikaeli, Yozabadi, Elihu, Silethai. Worri kuni qara gosa Manase keesa askarti kuma tokoti mataa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kunini ch'ufti askarti Daudileeti mataa tahe, wonti akanatiifi worri ch'ufti nama jajaba, waan woraana beekhu duuba eege worri askarti Israeli keesa guddinna argate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya ch'ufa nami askarti Dauditi darame, akanaani askartini isaa guddate lafa ira dabarte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Askarti Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa Daudini Hebroni jiru, askartini woraana hedduni d'ufte goli isaa taate, aka fulla Saulo hayyu isaa tolchitu, jecha AABBO Waaqa gula. Henni askarti isaa sunini kana:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23+1CH.12.24+1CH.12.25+1CH.12.26+1CH.12.27+1CH.12.28+1CH.12.29+1CH.12.30+1CH.12.31+1CH.12.32+1CH.12.33+1CH.12.34+1CH.12.35+1CH.12.36+1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23",
              "1CH.12.24",
              "1CH.12.25",
              "1CH.12.26",
              "1CH.12.27",
              "1CH.12.28",
              "1CH.12.29",
              "1CH.12.30",
              "1CH.12.31",
              "1CH.12.32",
              "1CH.12.33",
              "1CH.12.34",
              "1CH.12.35",
              "1CH.12.36",
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda: Kuma jaafi d'ibba sadeeti ta woraanafi wonte qabdu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23+1CH.12.24+1CH.12.25+1CH.12.26+1CH.12.27+1CH.12.28+1CH.12.29+1CH.12.30+1CH.12.31+1CH.12.32+1CH.12.33+1CH.12.34+1CH.12.35+1CH.12.36+1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23",
              "1CH.12.24",
              "1CH.12.25",
              "1CH.12.26",
              "1CH.12.27",
              "1CH.12.28",
              "1CH.12.29",
              "1CH.12.30",
              "1CH.12.31",
              "1CH.12.32",
              "1CH.12.33",
              "1CH.12.34",
              "1CH.12.35",
              "1CH.12.36",
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simeoni: Kuma torbafi d'ibba toko ta askartini tunini ch'ufti nama lola beekhu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23+1CH.12.24+1CH.12.25+1CH.12.26+1CH.12.27+1CH.12.28+1CH.12.29+1CH.12.30+1CH.12.31+1CH.12.32+1CH.12.33+1CH.12.34+1CH.12.35+1CH.12.36+1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23",
              "1CH.12.24",
              "1CH.12.25",
              "1CH.12.26",
              "1CH.12.27",
              "1CH.12.28",
              "1CH.12.29",
              "1CH.12.30",
              "1CH.12.31",
              "1CH.12.32",
              "1CH.12.33",
              "1CH.12.34",
              "1CH.12.35",
              "1CH.12.36",
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawi: Kuma afurifi d'ibba jaa; nami Yehoyada, ka d'aloota Haruni kuma sadifi d'ibba torba. Namicha janna toko ka Sadoki jed'ani: fiit'a isaa nama diddami lama ka biyyaa mata;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23+1CH.12.24+1CH.12.25+1CH.12.26+1CH.12.27+1CH.12.28+1CH.12.29+1CH.12.30+1CH.12.31+1CH.12.32+1CH.12.33+1CH.12.34+1CH.12.35+1CH.12.36+1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23",
              "1CH.12.24",
              "1CH.12.25",
              "1CH.12.26",
              "1CH.12.27",
              "1CH.12.28",
              "1CH.12.29",
              "1CH.12.30",
              "1CH.12.31",
              "1CH.12.32",
              "1CH.12.33",
              "1CH.12.34",
              "1CH.12.35",
              "1CH.12.36",
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benjamini (gosa Saulo): Kuma sadi (worri gosa Benjamini guddinni Saulo biraa indeemne);",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23+1CH.12.24+1CH.12.25+1CH.12.26+1CH.12.27+1CH.12.28+1CH.12.29+1CH.12.30+1CH.12.31+1CH.12.32+1CH.12.33+1CH.12.34+1CH.12.35+1CH.12.36+1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23",
              "1CH.12.24",
              "1CH.12.25",
              "1CH.12.26",
              "1CH.12.27",
              "1CH.12.28",
              "1CH.12.29",
              "1CH.12.30",
              "1CH.12.31",
              "1CH.12.32",
