        },
        {
          "text": "Askartini tunini ch'ufti ta lola kurfoofte, Hebroni d'at'e aka garaa tokooni Daudi hayyu Israeli tolchitu. Worri Israeli kaani ch'uftile akasuma woligale Daudi hayyu tolchu fed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
