          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle gochiti Isakaritifi Zabulonitifi ta Naftalileeni ch'ufti, ta fago mirga teetu, harreefi gaalafi gaangefi loonile sagale iti faate d'ufteeni — dargaye daakhani mid'aani odati, mid'aani zabibuti, daad'iifi d'ad'ale. Ammalle worri loonifi ree qaqalaanile ch'ufa d'ufeeni. Waan kana ch'ufa maro Israeli keesati gammadanifi tolchani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
